Embedded catalog (rule data)
========================================================================

File: catalog/catalog.json
Pin:  catalog/PIN.txt  (upstream tag v2.4.1 / url-sanitize-core 2.4.1)

Local overlay (custom rules, this repo): catalog/overlay.json
Merged at build time in src/sanitize.rs; survives catalog sync.

