========================================================================
Corresponding source (LGPL / MPL)
========================================================================

Catalog source as shipped: catalog/catalog.json and catalog/overlay.json
in this repository (and the git tag/commit that built a given release).

To rebuild wundspray with unmodified or modified rule data:

  1. Replace or edit catalog/catalog.json and/or catalog/overlay.json
  2. cargo build --release
  # or: docker build -t wundspray .

To refresh the upstream blob from a published url-sanitize release
(crate + catalog + PIN as one unit; overlay untouched):

  make sync-catalog            # newest crates.io release, or VERSION=vX.Y.Z
  make check

Upstream catalog provenance for the pinned tag:
  https://github.com/antonio-orionus/url-sanitize/tree/v2.4.1/crates/url-sanitize/catalog

